king":0},"body":"Although we try to avoid it, EqualConstraint occasionally fails with an error message like\n\n```\nExpected: some_value\n But was: some_value <== Same value in both messages\n```\n\nIssue #1778 illustrates such a case, producing the message\n\n```\nExpected: 0\n But was: 0\n```\n\nIt is proposed that we append the type in such a case.,.\n\n```\nExpected: 0 (System.Int32)\n But was: 0 (System.IntPtr)\n```\n\nNote this has to be done somewhere in the code where **both** the expected and the actual values are available and after the string representations have already been determined. Finding the right spot may be slightly tricky.\n\nNotes:\n1. We should only do this if the types are actually different, otherwise, do not bother.\n2. If a tolerance or other constraint modifier is in effect, we should investigate whether to enable this feature. The best course may be different for each modifier.\n","closed_by":{"login":"JustinRChou","id":9278003,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyNzgwMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9278003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou","html_url":"https://github.com/JustinRChou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JustinRChou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/1808/reactions","total_count